# Security and verification

Every protected operation needs authentication, company access, permission,
entitlement where applicable, resource ownership and RLS. Service-role code
must revalidate actor and company explicitly. Security-definer functions need
fixed `search_path`, minimal grants and cross-tenant tests. Report commands as
VERIFIED, PARTIAL, NOT RUN, UNVERIFIED or FAILED only.
